This product bundles Unicode Character Database (UCD), Unicode Security
Mechanisms and Unicode Emoji data, version 17.0, published by Unicode, Inc.
(https://www.unicode.org/Public/):

  * opennlp/tools/tokenize/uax29/WordBreakProperty.txt is the upstream
    WordBreakProperty-17.0.0.txt, unmodified except for the file name.
  * opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/confusables.txt is the upstream
    confusables.txt from the Unicode Security Mechanisms (UTS #39), unmodified.
  * opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/CaseFolding.txt is the upstream
    CaseFolding.txt (version 17.0.0) from the UCD, unmodified.
  * opennlp/tools/tokenize/uax29/ExtendedPictographic.txt keeps only the
    Extended_Pictographic lines of the upstream emoji-data.txt (Emoji Data for
    UTS #51, version 17.0).
  * opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/EmojiSequences.txt is a generated inventory
    of the fully-qualified emoji sequences from emoji-test.txt and the
    Emoji_Component ranges from emoji-data.txt, both Unicode Emoji 17.0:
    https://www.unicode.org/Public/17.0.0/emoji/emoji-test.txt
    https://www.unicode.org/Public/17.0.0/ucd/emoji/emoji-data.txt

The project-authored annotation table
opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/emoji-annotations.txt is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0, but its name values (the CLDR short names) and its
entity-type/category derivations are transcribed from the upstream
emoji-test.txt (version 17.0).

